 "plaques": [
  {
   "at": [
    13.8,
    0,
    3.2
   ],
   "rot": -135,
   "text": "CHARTER OF THE AMBER FOUNDRY\n\nLet no tallow of flesh or beast enter these kettles. Here the Guild boils only the comb of the Golden Skeps, gathered from the cliff-meadows while the noon was whole.\n\nFour votives in the South Cloister keep the Reliquary unbarred."
  },
  {
   "at": [
    0.0,
    0,
    13.8
   ],
   "rot": 0,
   "text": "THE GOLDEN SKEPS\n\nThe sun-bees do not sting the hand that smells of prayer. In glory their hives hum with remembered noon; in ruin the comb sets harder than bronze."
  },
  {
   "at": [
    -21.5,
    0,
    3.5
   ],
   "rot": 150,
   "text": "THE GUILDMASTER'S RELIQUARY\n\nHere rests the Censer-Mace of the First Chandler \u2014 flanged in vat-bronze, cored with an undying coal of royal wax. It answers strength of arm and devotion of spirit alike."
  },
  {
   "at": [
    -5.2,
    0,
    -10.5
   ],
   "rot": 20,
   "text": "EDICT OF REFUSAL\n\nBy hand of Malakor, Sovereign Chandler: The seventh wagon from the Hour Palace shall return empty. What light remains in the Queen-Combs belongs to the Parish and the bees. Let the Sovereign come down and skim the vats himself."
  }
 ],
